{"id":"d9a1e8d63f05ba98","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-lem-indiscernible.md","title":"Indiscernible Lemma","display":"lem-indiscernible — Indiscernible Lemma","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-lem-indiscernible","aliases":["58-lem-indiscernible"],"display":"lem-indiscernible — Indiscernible Lemma","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md]]","[[../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch02/58-thm-silver-indiscernibles.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-lem-indiscernible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-lem-indiscernible</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-indiscernible — Indiscernible Lemma"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2106ba11326cfe10\" href=\"?note=2106ba11326cfe10\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md\">../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md\">../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4e04cbefb6776d1b\" href=\"?note=4e04cbefb6776d1b\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-silver-indiscernibles.md\">../batch02/58-thm-silver-indiscernibles.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5578254565969219\" href=\"?note=5578254565969219\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md\">../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\gamma\">\\(\\gamma\\)</span> (ordinal length)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> (set of ordinals)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (constructible universe, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"de47935b5769dd1e\" href=\"?note=de47935b5769dd1e\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md\">../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\">\\(\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\)</span> (existence statement, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"16b215b0ea9d456b\" href=\"?note=16b215b0ea9d456b\" title=\"../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md\">../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-place set-function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> (metalinguistic predicate for a sequence of Silver indiscernibles of the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> (metalinguistic marker)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>类量词及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 采用 <code>58-df-class-embedding-data</code>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}\\)</span> 采用 <code>58-thm-silver-indiscernibles</code> 的有限递增元组定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\">\\(\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}\\)</span> 由下式给出。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{class}\">\\(\\mathrm{class}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}indiscernible} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\land\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\to\\exists\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,\\gamma,\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\beta,L)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\;(\\sup X&lt;\\beta(\\alpha))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}indiscernible} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\land\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\to\\exists\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,\\gamma,\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\beta,L)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\;(\\sup X&lt;\\beta(\\alpha))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\beta,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,\\gamma,\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\gamma\\;(\\beta(\\xi)\\in\\beta(\\eta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\n\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\subseteq I\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\beta,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,\\gamma,\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\xi&lt;\\eta&lt;\\gamma\\;(\\beta(\\xi)\\in\\beta(\\eta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\n\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\subseteq I\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>From <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^{\\sharp}\">\\(0^{\\sharp}\\)</span>, the Silver indiscernibles form a proper class, so any set-length tail above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup X\">\\(\\sup X\\)</span> can be selected.</li>\n<li>Indiscernibles are used to construct models and analyze consistency strength.</li>\n<li>The object-level upstream predicate applies to a set-coded structure and requires a full satisfaction package.  Since this lemma speaks about the proper class <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>, its indiscernibility clause is declared metalinguistic instead of being replaced by an invalid two-place call.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md","status":"resolved","id":"2106ba11326cfe10","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-indiscernible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-silver-indiscernibles.md","status":"resolved","id":"4e04cbefb6776d1b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-thm-silver-indiscernibles.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md","status":"resolved","id":"5578254565969219","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-class-embedding-data.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md","status":"resolved","id":"de47935b5769dd1e","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (constructible universe, see [[../batch15/58-df-constructible-universe.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md","status":"resolved","id":"16b215b0ea9d456b","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)$ (existence statement, see [[../batch02/58-thm-0-sharp.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (three-place set-function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-11","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ 取 [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{meta}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{class}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}indiscernible} \\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}} \\mathrm{Exists}(0^\\sharp)\\land\\gamma\\in\\operatorname{Ord}\\land X\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\to\\exists\\beta\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,\\gamma,\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta))\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\subseteq\\operatorname{Ord}\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\beta,L)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\gamma\\;(\\sup X<\\beta(\\alpha))\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibleSequence}_{\\mathrm{meta}}(\\beta,L)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists\\gamma\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\gamma)\n\\land\\mathrm{Function}(\\beta,\\gamma,\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\xi<\\eta<\\gamma\\;(\\beta(\\xi)\\in\\beta(\\eta))\\\\\n&\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{class}}I\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ProperClass}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I)\n\\land\\mathrm{SilverIndiscernibles}_{\\mathsf{meta}}(I,L)\n\\land\\operatorname{ran}(\\beta)\\subseteq I\\bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"0^{\\sharp}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup X","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false}],"bytes":3061,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3906","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-lem-indiscernible.md|58-lem-indiscernible]]（batch12）"}],"outgoing":["2106ba11326cfe10","16b215b0ea9d456b","de47935b5769dd1e","36d7463d215be751","4e04cbefb6776d1b","5578254565969219","5582a281f15a33c2"]}